+# Tasks
+
+- [x] 1. Add a transactional stock service/domain exception that resolves stock by the actual product/SKU, validates complete cart/order quantities, atomically decrements/restores quantities, and supports concurrency-safe conditional updates.
+- [x] 2. Integrate stock validation into cart creation/addition, single quantity updates, and multi-item updates, including HTTP 409 mapping and no-mutation behavior for rejected requests.
+- [x] 3. Integrate the stock service into both authenticated and anonymous checkout flows so insufficient stock prevents order creation and successful checkout decrements only matching products.
+- [x] 4. Enforce order cancellation transition rules, restore quantities once on active-to-CANCELED, and return HTTP 409 for attempts to change an already canceled order to another status.
+- [x] 5. Update v2 product mapping to derive `available` and `canBePurchased` from stock plus merchant availability, and add focused unit/integration coverage for cart, checkout, cancellation, and availability scenarios.
+- [x] 6. Run relevant Maven verification and OpenSpec validation, then review changed files for transaction and rollback correctness.
